<title>USA: Enzo Biochem sets 5 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Enzo Biochem sets 5 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGDALE, N.Y. 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enzo Biochem Inc said it declared a five percent stock dividend, payable October 29, record October 8.</p>
